{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/tbl-q-beta-categorical-precision-ladder-table1-data","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Table","doco:Table"],"label":"tbl:q-beta-categorical-precision-ladder-table1-data","kind":"table","title":"Data table 1 from prop:q-beta-categorical-precision-ladder","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-q-beta-categorical-precision-ladder"],"tags":["extracted-table"],"text":"q-beta-categorical-precision-ladder-table1-data.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"tbl:q-beta-categorical-precision-ladder-table1-data\"></a><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"right\">order</th>\n<th align=\"center\">coefficient</th>\n<th>categorical source</th>\n<th align=\"center\">empirical match</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">c_1</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">b</code></td>\n<td>Kashiwara <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\tilde f_1</code> matrix element on <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">V_{(2,1)}</code> crystal</td>\n<td align=\"center\">exact (definition)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">c_2</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">-1</code></td>\n<td>factor convention: <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(1 - b^2\\hbar_q^4)</code>, pure Kashiwara intra-block</td>\n<td align=\"center\">exact (definition)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">c_3</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">-2</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">J_{\\text{Hopf}}(q{=}1)</code> — classical-limit Jones of Hopf-link substructure at 3-fold Markov closure (cross-Wedderburn-block)</td>\n<td align=\"center\">near-match (~3% at <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q_0</code>; refuted real-<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">c_4</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">c_3 \\cdot b^4 = -2\\, b^4</code></td>\n<td>Hopf Jones <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\times</code> Kashiwara <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">b^4</code> correction (multiplicative mixing). Closed-form <strong>near-match</strong> (empirical tier).</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">99.1\\%</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">c_5</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">-(b^2 + 1/2)</code></td>\n<td>Kashiwara <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">b^2</code> + Hopf-half offset (mixed intra/inter); previously misattributed as <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">c_4</code> in earlier draft. Closed-form <strong>near-match</strong> (empirical tier).</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">99.9\\%</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/stochastic-mechanics/q-beta-categorical-precision-ladder-table1-data.md","heading":"Table"}
